  "description": "A local small business, proudly serving the Gulf Shores and Orange Beach areas for over 18 years. At the Massage Office we offer true therapeutic massage tailored to each client's individual needs. Prepare yourself for a whole being therapeutic massage vacation at the Massage Office in the heart of beautiful Orange Beach, Alabama. The Massage Office brings massage out of the day spa and into a massage only setting, making it an accessible part of your healthy life ritual. Come and enjoy our aromatherapy, heated tables, hot towels, soothing music and clean comfortable rooms. It is the perfect place to ease pain, de-stress, heal your body and center your mind! Enhanced sanitizing methods are in place for the health of our clients.",
